+- POLICY: M2 owns source pinning, reproducibility, asset hashes, and notices. Signing (`TASK-260715-3sk5cd`), notarization (`TASK-260715-387eof`), release attestation (`TASK-260715-1gzhnk`), and distribution approval (`TASK-260715-312u2k`) remain concrete M5 scopes; this task performs none of them.
