+- BOARD ANOMALY: Task/story development status cannot aggregate to epic `EPIC-260715-2lz67t` because its unfinished epic dependencies prohibit the required development transition; the explicit repair attempt exited 1 and the board leaves the blocked-by-dependency epic at backlog. This does not change the task evidence or justify weakening a supply-chain gate.
